 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Microsoft.EventHub api-version 2026-01-01 swagger. Every other official operation of this api-version returns HTTP 501 NotImplemented. Namespace and event hub metadata only: no endpoint, AMQP or Kafka listener, event, consumer group, authorization rule, SAS key or connection string exists. Event hubs get generated partition IDs; the partition count is 1-32 and cannot decrease. Capture, geo-replication and customer-managed keys are refused. Deleting a namespace deletes its event hubs; every other operation is not implemented (HTTP 501).",
  "title": "Event Hubs (Microsoft.EventHub, simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2026-01-01"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
